{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 11, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "gcd(x^4 + 1, x^2 + 1) = x^2 + 1 over GF(2)\n  how: Euclid; Bezout: (0)(x^4 + 1) + (1)(x^2 + 1) = x^2 + 1\n  check: the Bezout sum is the gcd; the gcd divides both\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 11, "ok": true, "cmd": "ring_gcd", "ucas": "gcd x^4-1, x^2-1 over GF(2)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "gcd", "method": "Euclid; Bezout: (0)(x^4 + 1) + (1)(x^2 + 1) = x^2 + 1", "headline": "gcd(x^4 + 1, x^2 + 1) = x^2 + 1 over GF(2)"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "the Bezout sum is the gcd; the gcd divides both"}], "files": [], "text": "gcd(x^4 + 1, x^2 + 1) = x^2 + 1 over GF(2)\n  how: Euclid; Bezout: (0)(x^4 + 1) + (1)(x^2 + 1) = x^2 + 1\n  check: the Bezout sum is the gcd; the gcd divides both\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 12, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "N(3 + 4i) = 25 in Z[i]\n  how: N(a + b*i) = (a + b*i)(a - b*i) = a^2 - (-1) b^2\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 12, "ok": true, "cmd": "ring_norm", "ucas": "norm 3+4i in Z[i]", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "norm", "method": "N(a + b*i) = (a + b*i)(a - b*i) = a^2 - (-1) b^2", "lhs": "N(3 + 4i)", "in": "Z[i]", "value": "25", "value_int": 25, "headline": "N(3 + 4i) = 25 in Z[i]"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "N(3 + 4i) = 25 in Z[i]\n  how: N(a + b*i) = (a + b*i)(a - b*i) = a^2 - (-1) b^2\n"}, "isError": false}}
